# T_SCRR: SCREEN output when the viewer's scratch file cannot be
# created: the message says to choose File output.  Then the listing in
# the viewer with memory short for the line offsets: the first lines
# only, saying how many, then their end, the last held line on the last
# row.
K TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB CTRL-S
S NOSCR
K CTRL-S
S VSHORT
K END
S VSEND
K ESC ESC
